    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>title: 2025-6-19<br>author: 嘻嘻哈哈郝<br>date: 2025-06-20 16:34:42</p><p>———结束大物的折磨，下午欣然北海一游，只觉心旷神怡，宠辱皆忘。更有怀民与游，沿西行，忘路之远近。<img src="/./../images/DSC04284.jpg"></p><p>猪猪鲤!嘻嘻</p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04285.jpg"></p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04286.jpg"></p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04287.jpg"></p><p>白塔</p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04288.jpg"></p><p>端端的一块珊瑚湖心石</p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04289.jpg"></p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04290.jpg"></p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04291.jpg"></p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04292.jpg"></p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04293.jpg"></p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04294.jpg"></p><p>晒太阳的好舒服</p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04295.jpg"></p><p>咪咪</p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04296.jpg"></p><p>咪好，人坏！</p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04297.jpg"></p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04298.jpg"></p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04299.jpg"></p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04300.jpg"></p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04301.jpg"></p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04302.jpg"></p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04303.jpg"></p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04304.jpg"></p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04305.jpg"></p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04306.jpg"></p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04307.jpg"></p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04308.jpg"></p><p><img src="/./../images/DSC04309.jpg"></p><p>北海，多好的去处</p><p><img src="/./../images/13632ae0d66ec01e0e1457cbb444abe.png" alt="附一张怀民去年拍的"></p><p>柳波，水波，船波，人波</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
